Well, and part of it's because you live longer, on average.

70
00:03:18,435 --> 00:03:19,370
Or you count on living longer.

71
00:03:19,370 --> 00:03:21,110
And you do, on average, live longer.

72
00:03:21,110 --> 00:03:25,160
For a person who's counting on living to 90, which many of

73
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:28,710
