86
00:04:06,350 --> 00:04:09,920
And then old age where you give other

87
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:12,920
people lots of advice.

88
00:04:12,920 --> 00:04:15,600
So we're going to talk about brain development from infancy

89
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:18,700
