00:52:39,610 --> 00:52:42,520
Positive and negative count about the same.

1304
00:52:42,520 --> 00:52:45,710
Look at older people.

1305
00:52:45,710 --> 00:52:47,900
Here's positive, and here's negative.

1306
00:52:47,900 --> 00:52:50,670
So this partly addresses the question for some people.

1307
00:52:50,670 --> 00:52:52,790
Are older people pretending they're positive?

1308
00:52:52,790 --> 00:52:53,940
Well, it doesn't look like that.

1309
00:52:53,940 --> 00:52:55,620
This is their amygdala as they're looking at it.

1310
00:52:55,620 --> 00:52:57,520
I don't know if their amygdala can pretend

1311
00:52:57,520 --> 00:52:59,300
