1381
00:55:46,360 --> 00:55:47,843
And this morning when I was thinking about this lecture, I

1382
00:55:47,843 --> 00:55:50,370
was thinking.

1383
00:55:50,370 --> 00:55:51,370
You might say this.

1384
00:55:51,370 --> 00:55:52,765
Think about experiences you've had that you've

