1406
00:56:36,160 --> 00:56:40,270
So it's very compelling that the reward in you occurs not

1407
00:56:40,270 --> 00:56:44,020
even so much for the reward itself, but the anticipation

1408
00:56:44,020 --> 00:56:47,040
of the reward is where it's biologically occurring when

1409
00:56:47,040 --> 00:56:50,120
you can anticipate and count on it correctly.

1410
00:56:50,120 --> 00:56:53,240
So, in humans, it's harder to deliver-- not impossible--

1411
00:56:53,240 --> 00:56:54,050
