1433
00:57:34,890 --> 00:57:36,200
This is not when the reward comes.

1434
00:57:36,200 --> 00:57:39,250
This is when you're anticipating the reward.

1435
00:57:39,250 --> 00:57:41,600
Here's another picture.

1436
00:57:41,600 --> 00:57:43,560
It's most powerful for when people

1437
00:57:43,560 --> 00:57:45,350
