1438
00:57:45,350 --> 00:57:49,140
And it's less responsive when people anticipate a loss.

1439
00:57:49,140 --> 00:57:51,880
So it's about gains.

1440
00:57:51,880 --> 00:57:54,970
Then the same system projects to the inferior parts of your

1441
00:57:54,970 --> 00:57:56,980
