1445
00:58:04,080 --> 00:58:05,970
So this is really interesting, a part of your brain that

1446
00:58:05,970 --> 00:58:07,960
responds to the anticipation, the

1447
00:58:07,960 --> 00:58:09,510
dopaminergic reward system.

1448
00:58:09,510 --> 00:58:11,660
And then another part of their brain that responds not

1449
00:58:11,660 --> 00:58:12,450
