1462
00:58:36,880 --> 00:58:38,750
gain as young adults.

1463
00:58:38,750 --> 00:58:42,060
So that's exactly responding to positive things and showing

1464
00:58:42,060 --> 00:58:46,440
less of a response to potential negative things.

1465
00:58:46,440 --> 00:58:48,440
So let's switch to adolescents.

